:false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-14T17:56:46Z","updated_at":"2025-10-06T12:23:40Z","closed_at":"2025-10-06T12:23:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot Engine v4.4.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot Engine v4.4.stable.official.4c311cbee - https://godotengine.org OpenGL API OpenGL ES 3.0.0 (ANGLE 2.1.1 git hash: 468fcbe033fa) - Compatibility - Using Device: Google Inc. (Intel) - ANGLE (Intel, Intel(R) HD Graphics 5500 (0x00001616) Direct3D11 vs_5_0 ps_5_0, D3D11-20.19.15.5107)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you rename a node in a parent scene that was used to inherit other scenes through scene instantiation. An error is generated if you updated the scene tree of the child scenes. A fair assumption is that the rename would've propagated in the child scenes as the symbols would've been updated, however this is not the case. Instead, an error is generated and the child's scene tree is updated with the node which was the child of the now renamed node, now, as a renamed orphaned node.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create parent scene\n\n> - **Action (Node)**\n>   - Info (Node)\n>   - Effects (Node)\n\n2. Instance 2 child scenes through scene inheritance\n\n> - **ChildA** & **ChildB**\n>   - Info (Node)\n>   - Effects (Node)\n\n3. In ChildB, add new node (Poison) to the Effects node.\n\n> - **ChildB**\n>   - Info (Node)\n>   - Effects (Node)\n>     - Poison (Node) \n\n\t\t\n4. Rename the Effects node in the parent EnemyEffects\n\n> - **Action (Node)**\n>   - Info (Node)\n>   - EnemyEffects (Node)\n\n5. In ChildA scene, the node is updated correctly. \n\n> - **ChildA**\n>   - Info (Node)\n>   - EnemyEffects (Node)\n\nHowever, in ChildB there is an error.\n\n> - **ChildB**\n>   - **Effects#Poison (Node)**\n>   - Info (Node)\n>   - EnemyEffects (Node)\n\n**Errors**\n- The node was renamed however, the child node was removed\n- The child node of the prior Effects node was orphaned and its name was updated to its previous parent\n- Log Messages\n  - ERROR: Node not found: \"Effects/Poison\" (relative to \"ChildB\").\n  - WARNING: scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp:178 - Parent path 'EnemyEffects' for node 'Poison' has vanished when instantiating: ''.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","